Changelog: 15-10-2026 22:51:18

Release 0.1.14.

Changelog: 15-10-2026 22:22:25

The leftover of the removed reboot question is gone: test-bazzite.sh's --no-prompt option ("skip the reboot question
at the end") did nothing any more but end the script with [ "$NO_PROMPT" = true ] && exit 0, which made a run without
it exit with code 1. The script now ends after the reports, with exit code 0, and still accepts --no-prompt silently,
so older commands keep working; it is out of the help, the GUI no longer passes it, and the wiki's development pages
no longer list it. The app gives advice only: it never reboots the board.

