The Readme page is now Manual: it shows the app's chapter of the manual (MANUAL.md in a release, the chapter itself in the checkout); links to other chapters open the online manual. install.sh copies the chapter as MANUAL.md when it installs from the suite checkout. Texts that said "see README" (help, the configuration hint, two engine notes) now say the manual.

