layer can draw there) and when it does work (windowed / borderless fullscreen).

Changelog: 06-10-2026 02:30:00

MangoHud style: all text is now white, and the purple dot in the top right corner of the box is
hidden. The dot is MangoHud's logging indicator (always on here because the FPS graphs need the
log); it is painted with engine_color, so the style sets engine_color to the background color,
which hides the dot and the FPS row label — the small white "FPS" next to the number remains.
