roundness, purple FPS, muted labels, the same metrics (GPU/CPU load, clock, temp, power, VRAM),
no frametime graph, top-left. Existing lines for those keys are replaced by one managed block at
the end of the file; everything else in the file is kept and the action can be repeated. MangoHud
has no border option, so the thin purple border has no equivalent there.

