Changelog: 06-10-2026 01:30:00

Game details page: new "Enable FPS logging" button. FPS in the overlay and graphs comes from
MangoHud's CSV log, which MangoHud keeps off by default — that is why the FPS pane stayed empty.
The button appends output_folder (a mangohud/ folder next to the session logs) and autostart_log=1
to ~/.config/MangoHud/MangoHud.conf (and Steam's Flatpak copy when present) without touching the
rest of the file, so every session with MangoHud logs FPS automatically. The game must still run
with MangoHud (`mangohud` in the launch line, or MANGOHUD=1 for Vulkan).

