Changelog: 05-10-2026 08:05:00

memtest_vulkan writes its own memtest_vulkan.log into whatever directory the script was started from,
so it never reached the log folder or the Desktop copy. The stress test now runs it in a private work
directory and saves that log as /var/log/bc250-bazzite-test/bc250-memtest-<timestamp>.log, copied to
the Desktop with the other reports. The log is read back as the desktop user, never as root, so a
symlink in the work directory cannot leak other files. README log tables updated.

