No more dependencies on an external CU manager:
- Test 21 reads the live WGP masks from the GPU registers itself (umr, read-only, needs root): a WGP counts
  when its SPI bit is set and its CC inactive bit is clear. Without root or umr it falls back to the kernel
  probe value and RADV, with a hint. Its state file, boot table and dashboard cache are no
