Changelog: 30-09-2026 13:00:00

TEST 44 — Internet Speed Test (new, opt-in with --speedtest):
- Ookla speedtest CLI (JSON output), speedtest-cli as fallback; runs as the desktop user, 180 s timeout.
- Download/upload Mbps and data used, idle latency and jitter, latency while downloading/uploading:
  a rise over 100 ms is a bufferbloat WARNING with an SQM hint, over 30 ms an INFO.
- Packet loss over 1% is a WARNING. VPN in the path is noted.
- Interface used (Ethernet/Wi-Fi) and link speed: 10/100 Mbit/s links warn (cable), a download near
  the link speed notes that the port is the limit. Wi-Fi gets a latency hint.
- Raw result to bc250-speedtest-<ts>.json, one line per run in bc250-speedtest-history.csv; both copied
  to the Desktop folder.

