TEST 42 — Performance Benchmark (new, opt-in with --bench[=SECONDS]):
- CPU: stress-ng matrixprod on 1 thread and on all threads (bogo ops/s). GPU: vkpeak fp32-scalar,
  fp32-vec4 and copy-d2d, with the GPU clock sampled during the run and the theoretical FP32 peak
